        "text": "IT support needs assessment",
        "level": 1,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d5050000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please answer these questions before our onboarding call. They help us understand how your business uses technology today and where you would like help. Answer as far as you can; it is fine to say you are not sure, and we will go through anything unclear on the call.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d5050000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We use your answers only to plan and provide our support to your business, and we keep them with your client records for as long as we support you. We do not share them with anyone else. Please do not write any passwords on this form.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
